   light-blue footer band). The default white fill creates too much
   contrast on a tinted surface and reads as "primary"; this variant
   swaps the fill to Card Grey — same luminance as the surface, warm
   hue — so the button reads as intentionally secondary via warm-on-
   cool material differentiation, not via low contrast.
   Hover brightens to Warm Wash (lighter step in the same warm family),
   echoing the primary button's brighten-on-hover behavior.

   Validated 2026-05-22 in arxiv-mockups/arxiv-public/html-redesign.html
   footer ("Help improve HTML papers" section).

   Example:
     <a class="ds-btn ds-btn-secondary on-tint" href="...">Submit a fix</a>
*/
